 the default field view. Approved address estimates use dashed rings and remain in the verification queue.</p><p>Battery readings are available only for Helios through Victron and Recon II through Reconeyez. The summary shows the lowest recent charge reading; open unit details for each battery or detector. Other families have no battery information. Camera health rereads saved observations every {Math.round(CAMERA_AUTO_REFRESH_MS/60000)} minutes while visible; router and power reads remain every {Math.round(AUTO_REFRESH_MS/60000)} minutes. Provider polling schedules are unchanged.</p></div></>}
